       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UNUSED.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
       01  WS-HOST-ONLY PIC X(8).
       01  WS-NEVER.
           05  WS-NEVER-A PIC X.
           05  WS-NEVER-B PIC 9.
       01  WS-GROUP.
           05  WS-CHILD PIC X.
       01  WS-FLAG PIC X.
           88  FLAG-ON VALUE 'Y'.
       01  WS-BASE PIC X(4).
       01  WS-OVER REDEFINES WS-BASE PIC 9(4).
       01  WS-COUNT PIC 99.
       01  WS-TABLE.
           05  WS-ENTRY OCCURS 1 TO 10 DEPENDING ON WS-COUNT PIC X.
       01  FILLER PIC X(10) VALUE 'FILLER'.
           COPY UNUSEDCP.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-UNUSED PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EXEC SQL SELECT NAME INTO :WS-HOST-ONLY FROM T END-EXEC.
           MOVE 'A' TO WS-CHILD.
           IF FLAG-ON
               DISPLAY 'ON'
           END-IF.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OVER.
           DISPLAY WS-ENTRY(1).
           GOBACK.
